     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Neighborhood services",
     "texto": [
      "**Στη γειτονιά μου** means «in my neighborhood». You can say **υπάρχει** + singular («there is») or **υπάρχουν** + plural («there are»).",
      "**Απέναντι από** means «across from», **ανάμεσα σε** means «between» and **σε πέντε λεπτά** expresses an approximate time to get somewhere."
